00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:58.470
MVVM is a design pattern that
works very commonly with C$

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:01.710
and XAML codebases,
but we can also do MVU

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:04.560
with an extended MVUX pattern.

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:09.060
So shorter dev loop, kind of a
cleaner way of doing things.

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:10.050
And again, it's going

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:13.860
