do this one at a time.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:29.820
But you get the idea.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.400
You can be in YOLO mode, where
you allow all the things.

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:34.200
So, again, for a simple search,

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:37.020
