exactly does one do MVUX design

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:44.940
pattern with C$ and XAML
for Uno Platform apps.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:48.210
So, again, it's finding all the
context, more doc searches,

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.200
